    "body": "I wrote about that elsewhere (too lazy to find it atm) but the probable culprit is PowerShell startup time. It is backed by CLR so this is kinda expected. \r\n\r\nHere is a question for you: which (sub)shell got spawned for the execution of your command? Reading through code I don't see any logs but it seems like it is using parent shell and cmd as a fallback.",
